  partName: Center Intake Manifold Gasket
  description: The Center Intake Manifold Gasket is a tiny, thin-flat component positioned
    at the middle-center-front of the engine, sealing the intake manifold to prevent
    air and fuel leaks. Made of Material.006, this gasket is vital for maintaining
    the engine's performance and preventing damage. Notably, the Center Intake Manifold
    Gasket works in conjunction with the Right and Lower Intake Manifold Gaskets
    to provide a comprehensive seal around the intake manifold.
